  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#attr-media-autoplay says \"The autoplay attribute is a boolean attribute. When present, the user agent (as described in the algorithm described herein) will automatically begin playback of the media resource as soon as it can do so without stopping.\"\r\n\r\nThis isn't accurate any longer. Maybe just add the note \"User agents do not need to support autoplay, and it is suggested that user agents honor user preferences on the matter.\"?\r\n\r\n@mounirlamouri \r\n\r\nContext: https://github.com/webcompat/web-bugs/issues/2803#issuecomment-278190599",
